    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχιτεκτον-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be architecl, chief constructor,</i> or
				<i>commissioner of works,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sosip.
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				656
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc., <i>design, construct,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριακοντήρη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
